{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing and fling your shoes to cause chaos in this physics-based mayhem. Discover secrets, unlock bonus levels and fill your journal with shiny stickers. Master the perfect throw to SHOE IT ALL!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET READY TO SHOE IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique swing-based aiming mechanic that challenges your precision and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.poster.avif?t=1759828485\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.webm?t=1759828485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.mp4?t=1759828485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each throw sends your shoes flying into destructible environments where chain reactions spark wild destruction and hilarious surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.poster.avif?t=1759828485\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.webm?t=1759828485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.mp4?t=1759828485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shiny stickers, unlock secret and bonus levels and complete your journal filled with all your wildest shoe-flinging moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.poster.avif?t=1759828485\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.webm?t=1759828485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.mp4?t=1759828485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2978860?t=1759828485","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/055b48dbf16a514048a557bdadede43e04904b85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759828485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/f4e61882f1b1fa7f88e987ef83c80e073961022b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759828485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/f4e61882f1b1fa7f88e987ef83c80e073961022b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759828485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3783290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing and fling your shoes to cause chaos in this physics-based mayhem. Discover secrets, unlock bonus levels and fill your journal with shiny stickers. Master the perfect throw to SHOE IT ALL!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET READY TO SHOE IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique swing-based ai